VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t01
GOAL
  clamp enforces both bounds.
CLAIM add REQUIRED
  ENSURE add works
CLAIM clamp-lower REQUIRED
  ENSURE lower bound enforced
CLAIM clamp-upper REQUIRED
  ENSURE upper bound enforced
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY add
  USING mini.t.add
VERIFY clamp-lower
  USING mini.t.clamp.lower
VERIFY clamp-upper
  USING mini.t.clamp.upper
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
